  "finding": "Counting the table's percentage loss only, fighting costs the defender less than the 30 % buy-out on average in every column; the closest is column +17 (29.4 % when fighting, 0.6 points under). Capture, overrun and a forced retreat that cannot be completed are not counted and could close that margin at the top columns, so the buy-out's appeal there is certainty and avoiding Engaged, not a clearly lower loss. Rolls in a printed gap are left out of the fight curve at +2 (8.3 % of rolls)."
